OL,5,G1930 Friday Night is Music Night
OL,6,     FRushil Ranjan and Abi Sampa with a
OL,7,     Fspectacular dialogue between
OL,8,     Fcenturies-old Sufi devotional
OL,9,     Ftraditions and Western symphonic
OL,10,     Fmusic. Melvin Tay conducts the BBC
OL,11,     FConcert Orchestra.
OL,12,G2145 The Essay: Solo
OL,13,     FA soloist prepares to play a
OL,14,     Fcelebrated piece of classical
OL,15,     Frepertoire. Pianist Mishka Rushdie
OL,16,     FMomen rehearses Beethoven's
OL,17,     FMoonlight Sonata.
OL,18,G2200 Late Junction
OL,19,     FIn a programme first broadcast in
OL,20,     F2023, Verity Sharp shares a
OL,21,     Fmixtape from stand-up comedian and
OL,22,     Frecord producer James Acaster.
